  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F / 220°C for 5 minutes.",
    "Toss the cubed potatoes directly on a baking sheet with the olive oil, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Spread the potatoes into an even layer and roast for 10 minutes until they begin to soften.",
    "Mix the whole grain mustard, lemon juice, and fresh dill in a small bowl.",
    "Remove the baking sheet from the oven, push the potatoes to one side, and place the green beans in the middle.",
    "Place the salmon fillets on the remaining open third of the pan and spoon the mustard mixture evenly over the fish.",
